    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wand, Uncommon (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>Won at a card table from a threadbare war-wizard, who kissed it once before sliding it across. \"Mind the cover,\" he said. \"It doesn't.\"</p><p>While holding this wand, you gain a +1 bonus to spell attack rolls. In addition, you ignore &amp;Reference[HalfCover] when making a spell attack roll.</p>",
